<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has destroyed bridges in Arakan, moved west of the Sittaung River and plans a 108‑kilometre fence on the Bangladesh border while airstrikes hit a displacement camp in Rakhine. In Sagaing, junta forces killed 11 people as Starlink outages isolated communities and health-care facilities kept being attacked in October 2026. Gold revenues now fund resistance groups and Myanmar-linked arsenic pollution is driving a clean-water scramble in Thailand. The top UN court will rule on Myanmar’s alleged genocide against the Rohingya, a verdict watched for Gaza implications, and Rohingya refugees pin hopes on it; 2,332 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/world/asia/myanmar-rohingya-muslim-genocide-world-court.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/18/us-sanctions-icj-judges-myanmar-genocide-ruling-israel-gaza-court&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQRTlfZHlvVHdUZ0FTeVlwa0YxamF6cmNKeXZ2eHlFSTYxN3RjREdhZU50MW0tSXdoWkkyXzJncUxCSTlVZGRpMzAzWmc2WUJNRnZkNEE0OUlWVFZMckNpUnM1R2RDd0F1YXNwOGNNUjIySDB2ZUJ0d2EwY202UldyaG1YUjhrMDJHX2ZCalF1UWNaUEhTdHJEc3VrUGlWdVdrNktFOF9aNnpGRGJkeV9rVUxmSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNOUhpSk